# Peakwise local API — copy to .env if you add secrets later.
# Never commit real credentials.

# Optional override for CORS when embedding the UI elsewhere.
# Comma-separated origins. Spaces around commas are ignored, and a trailing slash is removed.
# When unset, the API allows only the local Vite dev server:
# http://127.0.0.1:5173 and http://localhost:5173
# PEAKWISE_CORS_ORIGINS=http://127.0.0.1:5173, https://arnold-rg.github.io/
